1
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,664
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

2
00:00:05,872 --> 00:00:08,632
(Sheldon:)Penny, have you been recording
shows on our DVR again?

3
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:12,972
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Answer honestly. This is not a trial.

4
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:15,346
That will come later.

5
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:17,538
(Penny:)Absolutely not.

6
00:00:17,784 --> 00:00:20,754
(Penny:)Help me out here.
I can't afford another demerit.

7
00:00:21,621 --> 00:00:26,681
Uh, maybe we were hacked. The Chinese
have been hacking everything lately.

8
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:31,760
Why would the Chinese make our DVR
record Paul Blart: Mall Cop?

9
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,060
(Leonard:)I don't know.

10
00:00:35,301 --> 00:00:38,031
(Leonard:)It's a fat guy on a Segway.
That's funny everywhere.

11
00:00:39,139 --> 00:00:41,299
- I'm deleting it.
- Hang on.

12
00:00:41,508 --> 00:00:44,268
(Penny:)Maybe the Chinese
haven't finished watching it yet.

13
00:00:46,279 --> 00:00:48,339
(Leonard:)If you're trying to make space on the DVR...

14
00:00:48,548 --> 00:00:52,538
...why don't you get rid of stuff
you've already watched? Like Alphas.

15
00:00:52,786 --> 00:00:55,346
No, that's the season-two finale.
Quite the cliffhanger.

16
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:57,885
I'm gonna rewatch it
before season three starts.

17
00:00:58,091 --> 00:01:03,021
There's no season three.
They canceled that show.

